  "content": {
    "id": "p58-q1-group-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Factorise fully.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p58-q1-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$a^2-b^2+ac-bc$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(a-b)(a+b+c)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a^2-b^2+ac-bc&=(a-b)(a+b)+c(a-b)\\\\a^2-b^2+ac-bc&=(a-b)(a+b+c).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q2-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$6a^2+17a+12$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(3a+4)(2a+3)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}6a^2+17a+12&=6a^2+9a+8a+12\\\\6a^2+17a+12&=3a(2a+3)+4(2a+3)\\\\6a^2+17a+12&=(3a+4)(2a+3).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q3-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(x-y)^3-x+y$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x-y)(x-y-1)(x-y+1)$.\n\nExtract $x-y$, then use the difference of squares.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x-y)^3-x+y&=(x-y)^3-(x-y)\\\\(x-y)^3-x+y&=(x-y)\\big((x-y)^2-1\\big)\\\\(x-y)^3-x+y&=(x-y)(x-y-1)(x-y+1).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q4-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$81x^4-16y^4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(3x-2y)(3x+2y)(9x^2+4y^2)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}81x^4-16y^4&=(9x^2-4y^2)(9x^2+4y^2)\\\\81x^4-16y^4&=(3x-2y)(3x+2y)(9x^2+4y^2).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q5-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$21x^2-29xy-10y^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(7x+2y)(3x-5y)$.\n\nSplit the middle term into $-35xy+6xy$ and group.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}21x^2-29xy-10y^2&=21x^2-35xy+6xy-10y^2\\\\21x^2-29xy-10y^2&=7x(3x-5y)+2y(3x-5y)\\\\21x^2-29xy-10y^2&=(7x+2y)(3x-5y).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p58-q6-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$x^2+4x+4-25y^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x+2-5y)(x+2+5y)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+4x+4-25y^2&=(x+2)^2-(5y)^2\\\\x^2+4x+4-25y^2&=(x+2-5y)(x+2+5y).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
